acme_enterprise: {
  label: ||md
    ## Acme Corp

    [Enterprise]

    Internal systems owned by Acme.
  ||
  shape: rectangle
  retail_platform: ||md
    ## Retail Platform

    [Software System]

    Core platform for catalog, checkout, and order management.

